# Araña, Heart of the Spider: "Whenever you attack, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature" (CR 508.1m, 603.2), and "whenever
# a modified creature you control deals combat damage to a player, exile the top card of your library; you may play that card this
# turn" (CR 700.9, 510.2). Bot1 casts Araña and a Memnite on turn 1. On turn 3 both attack, the counter goes on the Memnite (2/2), and
